{
  "matches": [
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "To start, you need to identify the requirements for your trip."
      ],
      "justification": "The opening clause implicitly starts the process and describes the initial planning/requirement identification step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n2"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If you choose \"Select one way\", you can proceed with the process. However, if you choose \"Select return\", you can also continue with the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Describes the decision point and implicit selection step before splitting into two exclusive paths."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n3",
        "action:n3"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If you choose \"Select one way\""
      ],
      "justification": "Guard captures the exact value condition; action restates the positive path choice."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n4",
        "action:n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "However, if you choose \"Select return\""
      ],
      "justification": "Guard captures the exact value condition; action restates the alternative path choice."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n5"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After that, you will need to select the departure city"
      ],
      "justification": "\"After that\" signals the rejoining of split flows, leading directly into the departure city selection step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n6"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "and then the destination city."
      ],
      "justification": "Direct mapping to the sequential destination selection step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n7"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once you have chosen the destination city, you can proceed to select the class."
      ],
      "justification": "Describes the transition to and execution of the class selection step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once the class is selected, you can then choose your seat."
      ],
      "justification": "Direct mapping to the seat selection step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n9"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After selecting your seat, you will be prompted to enter the type and number of passengers."
      ],
      "justification": "Exact match for the passenger information input step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n10"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once you have entered this information, you can continue to the flight selection."
      ],
      "justification": "Maps directly to the flight selection step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n11"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Finally, once you have completed the flight selection, the process will come to an end."
      ],
      "justification": "Final step and explicit process termination signal."
    }
  ],
